{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While on his daily hike, Biggie discovers a glowing door on the side of a mountain he's never seen before! What awaits him inside?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/MagicDoor.gif?t=1743796746\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A CUB-SIZED ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 11 explorable rooms packed with their own characters and collectibles. Inspect every corner and you might be surprised at what you discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/Levels.gif?t=1743796746\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RESTORE THE LIBRARY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The library has been dormant for years.. Collect all of the crystal pieces and bring it back to it's former glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/Restore.gif?t=1743796746\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MAGIC ABOUNDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Biggie was blessed with the natural ability to perform spells. Find spell books throughout the library that grant him traversal and puzzle solving abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/Spell.gif?t=1743796746\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>...AND MORE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your snout to the ground as the game finishes development!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3638310?t=1743796746","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/5d6dcd84a02970ff1df19be60ba10d9996ffc8aa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743796746","capsule_image":"ht